{
  "dom_id": "step-31435",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Integrating Expressions Using the Double-Angle Formula for Sine",
  "problem": "Calculate\n$\\displaystyle \\int 4\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x \\, \\textrm{d}x.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we find the hyperbolic identity that corresponds to the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin {2\\theta}=2\\sin \\theta \\cos \\theta\n$$\n\nUsing Osborn's rule, we get the double-angle formula for the hyperbolic sine:\n\n$$\n\\sinh {2\\theta} =2\\sinh \\theta \\cosh \\theta\n$$\n\n \n\nLetting $\\theta= 2x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\sinh {4x} =2\\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sinh {4x}= \\sinh 2x \\cosh 2x.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4\\operatorname{sinh}⁡2x\\operatorname{cosh}⁡2x\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int 2\\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\int \\operatorname{sinh}⁡4x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-31435\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"31435\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"8440\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-31435\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Integrating Expressions Using the Double-Angle Formula for Sine</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"31435\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n    